    "Long time no see!": ["Long time no see! How have you been?","I've been great! You look good!","好耐冇見！近排點呀？ / 我好好！你氣色唔錯喎！"],
    "Have a good one!": ["Here's your receipt. Have a good one!","Thanks, you too!","呢張係你嘅收據，祝你今日愉快！ / 多謝，你都係！"],
