    "I'm here on vacation.": ["Are you here for work?","No, I'm here on vacation.","你嚟公幹㗎？ / 唔係，我嚟度假。"],
    "Excuse me.": ["Excuse me, is this the line for tickets?","Yes, it is. The end is over there.","唔該，呢度係咪排隊買飛？ / 係呀，隊尾喺嗰邊。"],
