    "Can I get the Wi-Fi password?": ["Can I get the Wi-Fi password?","Sure, it's on the back of your receipt.","可唔可以話我知 Wi-Fi 密碼？ / 得，就喺收據背面。"],
    "Could you take a picture of us?": ["Excuse me, could you take a picture of us?","Of course! Say cheese!","唔好意思，可唔可以幫我哋影張相？ / 當然得！嚟，笑一笑！"],
    "Can you write it down?": ["The address is 1428 Elm Street.","Sorry, can you write it down?","地址係 Elm 街 1428 號。 / 唔好意思，可唔可以幫我寫低？"],
    "No worries.": ["Sorry I'm a little late!","No worries. I just got here, too.","唔好意思，我遲咗少少！ / 唔緊要，我都係啱啱到。"],
